# GodotSteam — server-side SDK is locally installed but not vendored.
# Listen-server multiplayer (host = client + server in one process) only
# needs addons/godotsteam/. If a future feature ever needs the dedicated-
# server SDK, re-install GodotSteam Server from
# https://github.com/CoaguCo-Industries/GodotSteam-Server/releases
/addons/godotsteam_server/

